ble? It leverages existing CI/CD pipelines and sprint cycles (low overhead).\n    *   Is it effective? By making compliance a \"gate,\" it prevents the accumulation of technical/regulatory debt.\n\n    *   Rationale: This proposal proactively addresses the requirements for continuous record-keeping and up-to-date documentation, eliminating the existential risk of discovering non-compliance only at the end of the development cycle. It integrates regulatory obligations into the engineering workflow without introducing excessive bureaucracy.\n    *   Decision: Approve.\n    *   Promise: Very high (90-95). It's a classic \"shift-left\" strategy for compliance.",
