        "content": "{\n  \"screenings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P1783\",\n      \"rationale\": \"While primarily a regulatory requirement, these logging capabilities—specifically tracking reference database versions and matched inputs—are essential for the reproducibility and traceability of results in deployed systems. This infrastructure is critical to ensure that real-world performance data can be scientifically validated and audited, preventing a total loss of research impact due to regulatory shutdown.\",\n      \"decision\": \"approve\",\n      \"promise\": 85\n    }\n  ]\n}",
