ust implement the logging (which is mandatory); it implements the *utility* of those logs for compliance and operations.\n    *   It leverages existing infrastructure (observability stack), reducing waste.\n    *   It specifically targets Annex III paragraph 3 requirements, showing alignment with the strictest parts of Article 12.\n\n    *   Rationale: The proposal converts a passive regulatory requirement into an operational asset that directly facilitates Article 72 monitoring and risk mitigation, reducing legal exposure and improving system stability.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: High (e.g., 90-95). It solves the \"now what?\" problem after logs are collected.",
