bility.\n\n    *   Rationale: Planning logging schemas and retention policies upfront avoids costly retrospective architectural changes and ensures prototypes are built with compliance-ready telemetry from the start.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 90 (Very strong, though perhaps a slight friction point for PIs, it's technically sound).",
