        "content": "{\n  \"screenings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P1038\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Systematic logging is fundamental to the empirical analysis of AI behavior; without rigorous traceability, we cannot conduct scientific post-mortems or validate the intellectual merit of our systems' performance in real-world settings. While this is a procedural gate, it ensures that the data necessary for scientific reproducibility and failure analysis is captured by design.\",\n      \"decision\": \"approve\",\n      \"promise\": 80\n    }\n  ]\n}",
